{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>לאמר</b> (saying): Concerning the storehouses of grain they speak — perhaps a year of famine will come when this month passes and no rain descends; then we will sell grain dear. And they will make the ephah small, by which they measure the grain, and make the shekel large, to take more. And these are words of deceit by stone and by scales."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:33.211062408Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}